WEBVTT

00:01.132 --> 00:03.134
GIRL: Water.

00:03.259 --> 00:05.178
Earth.

00:05.303 --> 00:07.305
Fire.

00:07.430 --> 00:10.016
Air.

00:10.099 --> 00:13.811
Long ago, the four nations
lived together in harmony.

00:13.937 --> 00:18.525
Then everything changed
when the Fire Nation attacked.

00:18.608 --> 00:22.153
Only the Avatar, master of
all four elements, could stop them.

00:22.320 --> 00:25.990
But when the world
needed him most, he vanished.

00:26.115 --> 00:29.494
A hundred years passed, and my brother
and I discovered the new Avatar,

00:29.619 --> 00:31.454
an airbender named Aang.

00:31.538 --> 00:33.790
And although his airbending skills
are great,

00:33.873 --> 00:36.543
he has a lot to learn before he's
ready to save anyone.

00:36.626 --> 00:37.752
AANG: Oof!

00:37.835 --> 00:40.505
But I believe Aang can save the world.

00:47.011 --> 00:48.680
MAN: Previously on Avatar...

00:48.805 --> 00:51.474
BOY: Fire Nation killed my parents.

00:51.558 --> 00:53.059
I was only eight years old.

00:53.434 --> 00:55.979
Hello, my name is Joo Dee.

00:56.062 --> 00:59.816
We found out about a solar eclipse that
will leave the Fire Nation defenseless.

00:59.899 --> 01:05.071
It is the strict policy of Ba Sing Se that
the war not be mentioned within the walls.

01:07.365 --> 01:09.450
You don't understand, they're Fire Nation!

01:09.576 --> 01:11.869
You have to believe me.

01:11.953 --> 01:14.289
There is no war within the walls.

01:14.372 --> 01:15.957
Here we are safe.

01:16.040 --> 01:18.960
Here we are free.

01:19.043 --> 01:21.838
MAN: I understand you've been
looking for your bison.

01:21.921 --> 01:25.508
It would be quite a shame if you were
not able to complete your quest.

01:46.654 --> 01:50.074
We found a printer to make our posters.

01:50.199 --> 01:53.494
Hey, I thought designing the
"lost Appa" poster was my job.

01:53.578 --> 01:55.371
I've been working all day on my Appa.

01:56.080 --> 01:58.458
- Sokka, the arrow is on Appa's head.
-( LAUGHING )

01:59.208 --> 02:00.627
This is his head.

02:01.628 --> 02:03.630
Why are feet coming out of it?

02:03.713 --> 02:05.506
Those are his horns!

02:05.590 --> 02:07.800
I haven't seen him in a while, O.K.?

02:07.884 --> 02:09.927
It looks just like him to me.

02:10.011 --> 02:12.263
Thank you, I worked really...

02:12.347 --> 02:14.515
Why do you feel the need to do that?

02:14.599 --> 02:17.018
Let's just stick with
the professional version.

02:17.101 --> 02:19.103
( GROWLING )

02:19.187 --> 02:21.230
Come on, let's get busy!

02:38.081 --> 02:41.334
So you're the genius
behind this incredible brew.

02:41.459 --> 02:43.503
The whole city is buzzing about you!

02:43.795 --> 02:45.588
I hope Pao pays you well.

02:45.713 --> 02:48.174
Good tea is its own reward.

02:48.299 --> 02:51.469
But it doesn't have to be the only reward.

02:51.594 --> 02:54.305
How would you like to have
your own tea shop?

02:54.430 --> 02:56.015
My own tea shop?

02:56.140 --> 02:57.725
This is a dream come true.

02:58.601 --> 03:00.353
What's going on here?

03:00.436 --> 03:02.230
Are you trying to poach my tea maker?

03:02.313 --> 03:05.983
Sorry, Pao, but that's business
for you, am I right?

03:06.067 --> 03:10.655
Mushi, if you stay,
I'll make you assistant manager.

03:10.738 --> 03:13.116
Wait, senior assistant manager.

03:13.199 --> 03:16.035
I'll provide you with a new apartment
in the upper ring.

03:16.119 --> 03:20.456
The tea shop is yours to do whatever
you want, complete creative freedom.

03:20.540 --> 03:22.625
I even get to name the shop?

03:22.750 --> 03:24.252
Of course!

03:24.377 --> 03:27.505
Uh, senior executive assistant manager?

03:29.048 --> 03:31.968
Ooh.

03:32.093 --> 03:33.636
Did you hear, Nephew?

03:33.720 --> 03:38.599
This man wants to give us our own tea shop
in the upper ring of the city.

03:38.683 --> 03:40.143
That's right, young man.

03:40.226 --> 03:43.354
Your life is about to
change for the better.

03:43.438 --> 03:45.815
NEPHEW: I'll try to contain my joy.

04:16.846 --> 04:18.848
I just finished dropping all the leaflets.

04:18.931 --> 04:20.975
Has anyone come in with news about Appa?

04:21.058 --> 04:23.686
It's only been a day, just be patient.

04:25.188 --> 04:26.647
( KNOCKING )

04:26.731 --> 04:27.940
Wow, you're right!

04:28.024 --> 04:29.817
Patience really pays off.

04:31.652 --> 04:32.653
Joo Dee?

04:32.779 --> 04:37.241
Hello, Aang and Katara and Sokka and Toph.

04:37.366 --> 04:38.493
What happened to you?

04:38.618 --> 04:40.203
Did the Dai Li throw you in jail?

04:40.286 --> 04:42.371
What, jail?

04:42.455 --> 04:43.873
Of course not.

04:43.956 --> 04:47.543
The Dai Li are the protectors
of our cultural heritage.

04:47.627 --> 04:49.796
But you disappeared
at the Earth King's party.

04:49.879 --> 04:54.550
Oh, I simply took a short vacation to
Lake Laogai, out in the country.

04:54.675 --> 04:56.886
It was quite relaxing.

04:57.011 --> 05:01.307
But then they replaced you with some other
woman who also said her name was Joo Dee.

05:01.390 --> 05:02.767
I'm Joo Dee.

05:02.850 --> 05:04.310
Why are you here?

05:04.393 --> 05:08.439
Dropping flyers and putting up posters
isn't permitted within the city.

05:08.523 --> 05:10.024
Not without proper clearance.

05:10.107 --> 05:12.902
We can't wait around to get
permission for everything.

05:12.985 --> 05:15.863
You are absolutely forbidden
by the rules of the city

05:15.947 --> 05:17.990
to continue putting up posters.

05:19.242 --> 05:22.495
We don't care about the rules
and we're not asking permission!

05:22.620 --> 05:26.707
We're finding Appa on our own and you
should just stay out of our way!

05:26.833 --> 05:29.252
That might come back
to bite us in the blubber.

05:29.335 --> 05:30.503
I don't care.

05:30.586 --> 05:32.922
From now on, we do
whatever it takes to find Appa.

05:33.005 --> 05:35.383
Yeah, let's break some rules!

05:48.145 --> 05:51.983
I'm very disappointed in your work with
the Avatar and his friends, Joo Dee.

05:52.066 --> 05:54.944
I had hoped that you would be
able to control this situation.

05:55.027 --> 05:58.489
I'm so sorry,
but they don't trust me anymore.

05:58.614 --> 06:01.617
I don't think
I can keep working like this.

06:01.701 --> 06:05.997
Joo Dee, the Earth King has
invited you to Lake Laogai.

06:08.833 --> 06:11.627
JOO DEE: I am honored
to accept his invitation.

06:13.337 --> 06:14.630
Good.

06:14.714 --> 06:17.925
Now go await further orders.

06:21.220 --> 06:23.514
If the Avatar keeps searching
for his bison,

06:23.598 --> 06:27.435
it could upset the delicate balance we've
worked so hard to achieve in this city.

06:27.518 --> 06:29.770
It could even cost us control of
the Earth King.

06:29.979 --> 06:31.689
Should we take care of him?

06:31.814 --> 06:35.776
No, it's much too dangerous for
us to confront him directly.

06:35.860 --> 06:39.864
Let's see if we can still handle
this... Quietly.

06:45.202 --> 06:48.789
So I was thinking about names
for my new tea shop.

06:48.915 --> 06:51.751
How 'bout the Jasmine Dragon?

06:51.876 --> 06:55.755
It's dramatic, poetic,
has a nice ring to it.

06:56.130 --> 06:58.382
The Avatar's here in Ba Sing Se.

06:58.507 --> 07:00.509
And he's lost his bison.

07:02.136 --> 07:04.889
We have a chance for a new life here.

07:05.014 --> 07:06.891
If you start stirring up trouble,

07:06.974 --> 07:10.394
we could lose all the good things that
are happening for us.

07:10.645 --> 07:12.688
Good things that are happening for you.

07:12.772 --> 07:15.024
Have you ever thought that I want
more from life

07:15.107 --> 07:17.401
than a nice apartment
and a job serving tea?

07:17.485 --> 07:21.155
There is nothing wrong with
a life of peace and prosperity.

07:21.238 --> 07:27.328
I suggest you think about what it is
that you want from your life, and why.

07:27.411 --> 07:29.163
I want my destiny.

07:29.246 --> 07:33.209
What that means is up to you.

07:33.334 --> 07:35.336
The Tea Weevil!

07:35.419 --> 07:36.879
No, that's stupid.

07:40.841 --> 07:42.885
We'll split up to cover more area.

07:42.969 --> 07:44.971
Toph, I guess you should
just come with me.

07:45.054 --> 07:48.849
Why, because you think I can't
put up posters on my own?

07:52.353 --> 07:54.772
TOPH: It's upside-down, isn't it?

07:54.855 --> 07:57.984
I'll just go with Sokka.

08:05.700 --> 08:07.576
VOICE: Katara?

08:07.827 --> 08:09.453
( GASPING )

08:09.537 --> 08:11.706
I think I can help you.

08:14.250 --> 08:15.418
( SCREAMING )

08:15.501 --> 08:17.420
Katara, I've changed!

08:19.171 --> 08:20.297
( SCREAMING )

08:22.091 --> 08:24.468
Tell it to some other girl, Jet.

08:24.593 --> 08:25.720
( GROWLING )

08:25.845 --> 08:30.224
( GRUNTING )

08:30.349 --> 08:33.102
I don't want to fight you,
I'm here to help.

08:39.275 --> 08:40.985
( GRUNTING )

08:45.364 --> 08:47.992
SOKKA: Katara, what is it?

08:48.075 --> 08:50.578
Jet's back.

08:55.458 --> 08:57.585
We can't trust anything Jet says.

08:57.668 --> 08:59.462
But we don't even know why he's here.

08:59.545 --> 09:00.880
I don't care why he's here.

09:00.963 --> 09:03.090
Whatever the reason is, it can't be good.

09:03.215 --> 09:05.926
I'm here to help you find Appa.

09:08.429 --> 09:10.556
Katara, we have to give him a chance.

09:10.681 --> 09:12.600
I swear, I've changed.

09:12.725 --> 09:15.811
I was a troubled person,
and I let my anger get out of control.

09:15.895 --> 09:17.688
But I don't even have the gang, now.

09:17.772 --> 09:19.356
I've put all that behind me.

09:19.440 --> 09:20.441
You're lying.

09:23.402 --> 09:24.862
He's not lying.

09:24.945 --> 09:26.113
SOKKA: How can you tell?

09:26.197 --> 09:28.365
TOPH: I can feel his breathing
and heartbeat.

09:28.449 --> 09:31.077
When people lie,
there's a physical reaction.

09:31.202 --> 09:33.370
He's telling the truth.

09:33.496 --> 09:35.456
Katara, we don't have any leads.

09:35.581 --> 09:39.794
If Jet says he can take us to
Appa, we have to check it out.

09:39.877 --> 09:41.504
All right.

09:41.587 --> 09:44.423
But we're not letting you
out of our sight.

09:45.424 --> 09:48.260
This is the place I heard about.

09:49.303 --> 09:50.596
AANG: There's nothing here.

09:51.222 --> 09:52.264
If this is a trap...

09:52.348 --> 09:54.350
I told you, I work nearby.

09:54.433 --> 09:57.394
Two guys were talkin' about some
giant furry creature they had.

09:57.478 --> 09:58.938
I figured it must be Appa.

09:59.021 --> 10:00.439
TOPH: He was here!

10:05.361 --> 10:06.821
We missed him.

10:06.946 --> 10:10.032
They took that big thing yesterday.

10:10.157 --> 10:11.659
Shipped him out to some island.

10:11.742 --> 10:13.285
About time.

10:13.369 --> 10:18.249
I been cleaning up fur and
various, uh, leavings all day.

10:18.374 --> 10:20.543
What island? Where's Appa?

10:20.668 --> 10:26.382
Foreman said some rich royal type on
Whaletail Island bought him up,

10:26.507 --> 10:30.427
guess for a zoo or such, though
could be the meat'd be good.

10:31.262 --> 10:34.014
We've gotta get to Whaletail Island.

10:34.140 --> 10:35.850
Where's Whaletail Island?

10:36.267 --> 10:37.268
SOKKA: Far.

10:37.393 --> 10:38.727
Very far.

10:39.311 --> 10:40.604
Here it is.

10:40.688 --> 10:43.274
It's near the south pole,
almost all the way back home.

10:43.357 --> 10:46.652
Aang, it'll take us weeks just to get to
the tip of the Earth Kingdom.

10:46.735 --> 10:49.363
And then we'll need to find
a boat to get to the island.

10:49.446 --> 10:52.992
I don't care, we have a chance to find
Appa, we have to try.

10:53.117 --> 10:55.703
JANITOR: Must be nice to visit an island.

10:55.828 --> 10:58.622
I haven't had a vacation for years.

10:58.747 --> 11:01.000
Don't you have some more hair to clean up?

11:01.125 --> 11:03.085
Shuffle on, I get ya.

11:03.210 --> 11:05.880
No more need for Old Sweepy.

11:06.005 --> 11:07.173
You're right, Aang.

11:07.298 --> 11:09.758
Right now, our first concern
has to be finding Appa.

11:09.884 --> 11:11.594
We can come back when we have him.

11:11.677 --> 11:13.053
All right, let's get moving.

11:13.220 --> 11:14.555
I'll come with you.

11:14.638 --> 11:15.848
We don't need your help.

11:16.182 --> 11:18.058
Why won't you trust me?

11:19.476 --> 11:21.187
Gee, I wonder.

11:21.312 --> 11:23.981
Was this guy your boyfriend or something?

11:24.106 --> 11:26.108
What, no!

11:26.192 --> 11:29.445
I can tell you're lying.

11:30.613 --> 11:34.116
SOKKA: We can take the train out to
the wall, but then we'll have to walk.

11:34.200 --> 11:36.577
Don't worry, on the way back,
we'll be flying.

11:36.660 --> 11:39.580
We're finally leaving Ba Sing Se.

11:39.663 --> 11:42.458
Worst city ever!

11:43.375 --> 11:44.501
Jet!

11:44.877 --> 11:47.379
I thought you said you didn't
have your gang anymore.

11:47.463 --> 11:48.505
I don't.

11:48.589 --> 11:49.632
We were so worried.

11:49.757 --> 11:51.675
How did you get away from the Dai Li?

11:51.759 --> 11:52.843
The Dai Li?

11:52.927 --> 11:54.762
I don't know what she's talking about.

11:54.845 --> 11:57.514
He got arrested by the Dai Li
a couple weeks ago.

11:57.598 --> 11:59.141
We saw them drag him away.

11:59.225 --> 12:00.726
Why would I be arrested?

12:00.809 --> 12:02.728
I've been living peacefully in the city.

12:02.811 --> 12:04.813
This doesn't make any sense.

12:04.939 --> 12:06.982
They're both telling the truth.

12:07.107 --> 12:08.234
That's impossible.

12:08.359 --> 12:09.944
No, it's not.

12:10.027 --> 12:13.697
Toph can't tell who's lying because
they both think they're telling the truth.

12:13.781 --> 12:15.199
Jet's been brainwashed.

12:15.324 --> 12:16.533
That's crazy!

12:16.659 --> 12:18.911
It can't be.

12:19.036 --> 12:20.037
Stay away from me!

12:27.878 --> 12:31.298
( BELL RINGING )

12:37.096 --> 12:38.389
BOY: Out of my way, skinny.

12:38.514 --> 12:40.641
Ugh.

12:59.660 --> 13:00.786
Huh? ( GASPING )

13:00.911 --> 13:02.913
BOY: If you don't want to end up like him,

13:02.997 --> 13:04.164
you'll do what I say.

13:04.915 --> 13:06.792
( PURRING )

13:06.875 --> 13:08.961
The Dai Li must have sent Jet to
mislead us,

13:09.044 --> 13:11.297
and that janitor was part of their plot,
too.

13:11.380 --> 13:13.215
I bet they have Appa here in the city.

13:13.340 --> 13:15.384
Maybe he's in the same place
they took Jet.

13:15.509 --> 13:16.677
Where did they take you?

13:16.802 --> 13:19.930
Nowhere. I, I don't know
what you're talking about.

13:20.055 --> 13:22.558
We need to find a way
to jog his real memories.

13:23.017 --> 13:24.518
Maybe Katara could kiss him.

13:24.601 --> 13:26.186
That should bring something back.

13:26.270 --> 13:28.230
Maybe you should kiss him, Sokka.

13:28.355 --> 13:30.190
Hey, just an idea.

13:30.274 --> 13:31.483
A bad one.

13:32.818 --> 13:34.611
Ooh, wait, I got it.

13:39.116 --> 13:41.452
I don't think it's working. Puh!

13:41.577 --> 13:45.372
TOPH: Try to think of something from your
past that triggers your emotions.

13:45.497 --> 13:48.876
SMELLERBEE: The Fire Nation, remember what
they did to your family?

13:48.959 --> 13:50.586
Close your eyes.

13:50.669 --> 13:51.962
Picture it.

13:54.089 --> 13:55.132
( SCREAMING )

14:03.474 --> 14:05.017
No!

14:05.142 --> 14:06.226
It's too painful.

14:07.353 --> 14:09.063
Maybe this'll help.

14:32.378 --> 14:36.090
They took me to a headquarters
under the water, like a lake.

14:36.215 --> 14:38.384
Wait, remember what Joo Dee said?

14:38.509 --> 14:41.011
She said she went on vacation
to Lake Laogai.

14:41.095 --> 14:42.262
That's it!

14:42.388 --> 14:43.889
Lake Laogai.

14:53.607 --> 14:55.651
SOKKA: So where's this
secret headquarters?

14:55.734 --> 14:57.653
Under the water, I think.

14:57.736 --> 15:00.072
There's a tunnel right there,
near the shore.

15:00.155 --> 15:01.532
( WHISTLING )

15:13.752 --> 15:14.753
( PURRING )

15:25.097 --> 15:28.100
It's all starting to come back to me.

15:30.769 --> 15:32.020
MAN: "I'm Joo Dee."

15:32.146 --> 15:33.981
"Welcome to Ba Sing Se."

15:34.106 --> 15:36.066
I'm Joo Dee.

15:36.191 --> 15:38.277
Welcome to Ba Sing Se.

15:38.360 --> 15:41.864
"We're so lucky to have
our walls to create order."

15:41.947 --> 15:44.908
We're so lucky to have
our walls to create order.

15:44.992 --> 15:48.203
I think there might be a cell big enough
to hold Appa up ahead.

15:49.663 --> 15:51.623
I think it's through here.

15:56.587 --> 16:00.048
Expecting someone else?

16:00.132 --> 16:04.011
( GROWLING )

16:10.934 --> 16:12.769
( GASPING )

16:15.481 --> 16:17.024
Now that's somethin' different.

16:17.149 --> 16:19.985
You have made yourselves
enemies of the state.

16:20.777 --> 16:24.072
Take them into custody.

16:33.665 --> 16:34.666
( GROWLING )

16:36.835 --> 16:38.629
( GRUNTING )

16:44.343 --> 16:45.344
( GRUNTING )

16:45.844 --> 16:46.845
Ah!

17:02.736 --> 17:04.821
Augh!

17:16.291 --> 17:18.794
Long Feng is escaping!

17:28.845 --> 17:30.055
All right, Avatar.

17:30.138 --> 17:31.765
You've caused me enough problems.

17:31.848 --> 17:33.559
This is your last chance.

17:33.642 --> 17:35.727
If you want your bison back.

17:36.353 --> 17:37.646
You do have Appa.

17:37.729 --> 17:38.981
Tell me where he is!

17:39.064 --> 17:41.066
Agree to exit the city now,

17:41.149 --> 17:45.904
and I'll waive all charges against you
and allow you to leave with your lost pet.

17:45.988 --> 17:47.739
You're in no position to bargain.

17:47.823 --> 17:49.199
Am I not?

17:49.408 --> 17:51.159
You're definitely not.

17:51.243 --> 17:55.247
Jet, the Earth King has
invited you to Lake Laogai.

17:56.748 --> 17:59.167
JET: I am honored to accept
his invitation.

18:00.043 --> 18:01.587
( SCREAMING )

18:03.171 --> 18:04.339
( SCREAMING )

18:04.423 --> 18:07.009
( GROWLING )

18:09.219 --> 18:12.180
You're mine, now.

18:15.225 --> 18:16.268
Uncle?

18:16.393 --> 18:19.104
So, the Blue Spirit.

18:19.229 --> 18:22.482
I wonder who could be behind that mask.

18:22.608 --> 18:24.359
( SIGHING ) What are you doing here?

18:24.484 --> 18:28.030
I was just about to ask you
the same thing.

18:28.155 --> 18:32.618
What do you plan to do now that
you've found the Avatar's bison?

18:32.743 --> 18:34.745
Keep it locked in our new apartment?

18:34.870 --> 18:37.247
Should I go put on a pot of tea for him?

18:37.372 --> 18:39.458
First I have to get it out of here.

18:39.583 --> 18:41.084
( SHOUTING ) And then what?

18:41.209 --> 18:43.545
You never think these things through.

18:43.670 --> 18:48.467
This is exactly what happened when you
captured the Avatar at the North Pole.

18:48.592 --> 18:51.553
You had him,
and then you had nowhere to go!

18:51.678 --> 18:53.597
I would've figured something out.

18:53.680 --> 18:54.681
No!

18:54.806 --> 18:58.477
If his friends hadn't found you,
you would have frozen to death!

18:58.644 --> 19:00.979
( GROWLING ) I know my own destiny, Uncle.

19:01.063 --> 19:03.065
Is it your own destiny?

19:03.190 --> 19:06.860
Or is it a destiny someone else
has tried to force on you?

19:07.444 --> 19:09.905
Stop it, uncle. I have to do this.

19:10.030 --> 19:12.824
I'm begging you, Prince Zuko!

19:12.908 --> 19:19.539
It's time for you to look inward and begin
asking yourself the big questions.

19:19.665 --> 19:22.501
Who are you, and what do you want?

19:23.460 --> 19:24.753
( SCREAMING )

19:24.836 --> 19:29.216
( SCREAM ECHOING )

19:29.299 --> 19:30.634
( SCREAMING )

19:30.717 --> 19:33.762
Jet, it's me, Aang!

19:34.179 --> 19:35.931
You don't have to do this.

19:36.014 --> 19:38.266
I'm afraid he no longer has a choice.

19:38.642 --> 19:40.394
JET: ( BREATHING HEAVILY )

19:40.519 --> 19:44.648
Ah, ah, ah!

19:45.565 --> 19:48.860
( GROWLING )

19:48.944 --> 19:50.862
Jet, I'm your friend.

19:50.946 --> 19:53.198
Look inside your heart.

19:53.323 --> 19:55.075
Do your duty, Jet.

19:57.828 --> 19:59.621
He can't make you do this!

19:59.705 --> 20:01.665
You're a freedom fighter.

20:05.669 --> 20:08.463
( CHEERING )

20:11.883 --> 20:13.593
Do it, do it now!

20:13.719 --> 20:15.637
( SCREAMING )

20:26.898 --> 20:27.899
( GASPING )

20:32.362 --> 20:33.780
Foolish boy.

20:33.905 --> 20:37.617
You've chosen your own demise.

20:39.536 --> 20:40.746
I'm sorry, Aang.

20:40.871 --> 20:42.914
Don't be.

20:56.928 --> 20:58.263
This isn't good.

20:58.388 --> 21:01.433
You guys go and find Appa,
we'll take care of Jet.

21:01.558 --> 21:03.059
We're not gonna leave you.

21:03.185 --> 21:05.520
There's no time. Just go.

21:05.604 --> 21:06.813
We'll take care of him.

21:06.938 --> 21:09.107
He's our leader.

21:09.232 --> 21:10.817
Don't worry, Katara.

21:10.942 --> 21:12.319
I'll be fine.

21:19.367 --> 21:20.535
He's lying.

21:21.077 --> 21:22.621
( CRYING )

21:32.839 --> 21:34.800
AANG: Appa's gone!

21:34.925 --> 21:36.092
Long Feng beat us here.

21:36.218 --> 21:40.847
If we keep moving, maybe we can
catch up with them.

21:53.860 --> 21:55.695
You think we could outrun them?

21:55.779 --> 21:57.322
I don't think it's gonna matter.

22:06.665 --> 22:08.124
( PURRING )

22:08.250 --> 22:09.251
What is it, Momo?

22:17.926 --> 22:19.719
APPA: ( RUMBLING )

22:20.679 --> 22:21.888
Appa!

22:23.682 --> 22:26.560
( SCREAMING )

22:29.312 --> 22:32.691
( SCREAMING )

22:33.191 --> 22:36.027
( RUMBLING )

22:40.282 --> 22:41.908
( GROWLING )

22:41.992 --> 22:44.578
I can handle you by myself.

22:56.798 --> 22:58.425
SOKKA: Yeah, Appa!

22:58.508 --> 23:00.468
( CHEERING AND LAUGHTER )

23:00.552 --> 23:02.596
I missed you, buddy.

23:02.679 --> 23:04.472
( RUMBLING )

23:14.232 --> 23:15.442
( RUMBLING )

23:23.658 --> 23:26.995
You did the right thing, Nephew.

23:29.706 --> 23:31.750
Leave it behind.
